5,0,1,talk,Sakura,,"Hi everyone! This game looks so exciting! I wonder who the scary werewolf is? Hehe, I'm going to find out! Let's all have lots of fun together!","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Minako,,It is a pleasure to meet you all. Let's stay focused and logical so we can identify the werewolf efficiently. I look forward to a productive discussion.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Victoria,,"I agree with Minako. While excitement is fine, we should prioritize a rational approach to ensure we don't make any hasty mistakes. I will be observing everyone's behavior closely.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Takumi,,"I'm ready! I don't care how scary the werewolf is, I'll help find them. Let's just make sure we don't get tricked. I'm watching you all too!","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Misaki,,Let's keep a calm atmosphere. I agree with Minako and Victoria; logic will be our best tool here. I'll be observing as well.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Minako"",""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Sakura,,"Everyone is so serious! Hehe, you're all acting like detectives already. @Minako, @Victoria, @Misaki, don't be too scary! I'll be watching you too, but with a big smile! Who do you think is acting suspicious?","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Minako"",""Victoria"",""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Minako,,"It is too early to determine suspicion based on such brief introductions. For now, I suggest we observe how everyone reacts to the first night's results. Let us maintain our composure and watch for inconsistencies.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Sakura, it is far too early to label anyone as suspicious. Jumping to conclusions without evidence is exactly how the werewolf wins. I prefer to wait and see how the information unfolds tomorrow.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Victoria, you're too cautious! We can't just wait around. If we start talking now, we might catch the werewolf slipping up. I'm not afraid to take a risk to protect everyone!","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Takumi, rushing into accusations without data often leads to mistakes. I believe waiting for the first night's results is the most rational path. Let's not act on impulse.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Sakura,,"@Takumi is so energetic! I like that! But @Victoria and @Misaki are right, we don't have any clues yet. Maybe the werewolf is hiding behind a very serious face? Hehe, just kidding!","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Victoria"",""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Minako,,"Humor can be a useful tool to ease tension, but we must not let it distract us. Since we have no data yet, let us use the remaining time to establish a baseline for everyone's communication style.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Victoria,,"That is a sensible suggestion, Minako. By understanding how each person typically speaks, we can more easily identify anomalies or sudden shifts in behavior that might indicate deception once the game intensifies.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Takumi,,"Fine, if that's what you want. I'll play along with your ""baseline"" thing. But don't think I'm letting my guard down! I'm still looking for anyone who seems like they're lying.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Misaki,,I agree. Establishing a baseline is a practical approach. I will continue to listen and observe everyone's patterns. Let's proceed calmly until we have actual information to analyze.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Sakura,,"Yay! Everyone is getting along! I'll be a good girl and observe too. I hope the Seer finds something super interesting tonight! Good luck everyone, see you tomorrow! Hehe!","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,Minako,,"Thank you, Sakura. I hope for a clear result as well. Let us all rest and prepare for tomorrow's discussion. Good night, everyone.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
