37,1,1,talk,Victoria,,"@Minako, thank you for sharing that information so quickly. Knowing Takumi is human provides a useful starting point. Now, we must consider if this claim is genuine or a strategic move by the werewolf.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Minako"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
