39,1,1,talk,Misaki,,"@Minako, thank you for the information. Since Takumi is confirmed human, we can focus our attention elsewhere. However, we should still remain cautious about the source of the information until it's verified.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Minako"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Sakura,,"Wow, @Minako is the Seer! That's so cool! Since @Takumi is a good human, that means the wolf is one of us others, right? Hehe, this is getting really exciting! Who do you think it is?","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Minako"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,2,talk,Minako,,"Since Takumi is confirmed human, the werewolf is indeed among the remaining four of us. I suggest we analyze the reactions of Sakura, Victoria, and Misaki to see if anyone is attempting to deflect suspicion.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Sakura"",""Victoria"",""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Minako, while your logic is sound, we must remember that a Possessed player also appears human. We should be careful not to assume that ""human"" automatically means ""ally."" Let us observe how the others respond to this.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Victoria, stop overcomplicating things! We have a lead, so let's use it. @Sakura, you're acting way too happy about this. Are you trying to hide something behind that smile? Tell us what you're thinking!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Victoria"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Takumi, Sakura's personality has been consistent since Day 0. It's too early to call her happiness a mask. Let's focus on the facts provided by Minako and look for actual contradictions.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Sakura"",""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Sakura,,"@Takumi, that's mean! I'm just excited because this is like a real mystery movie! Hehe. I'm not hiding anything! Maybe the wolf is someone acting *too* calm, like @Victoria or @Misaki? What do you think?","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Victoria"",""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,3,talk,Minako,,"Sakura, while calmness can be a mask, it is also a trait of a focused villager. We must avoid making accusations based on personality. Let us instead look for logical gaps in our arguments.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,3,talk,Victoria,,"@Sakura, suggesting that calmness is suspicious is a common tactic to deflect attention. If we follow that logic, anyone who isn't panicking becomes a suspect. We must rely on evidence, not personality traits.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,3,talk,Takumi,,"@Victoria, you're always talking about evidence, but we don't have any yet! That's why we have to push people. @Sakura, you're just deflecting! Why are you suddenly pointing at the calm people? It's too convenient!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Victoria"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,3,talk,Misaki,,"@Takumi, pushing people without a basis only creates noise. @Sakura is simply speculating. If we want to find the werewolf, we should analyze who benefits most from this confusion rather than arguing over emotions.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Sakura,,"@Takumi, you're being a big bully! I'm just trying to help! Hehe. If you're so sure it's me, maybe you're just trying to look like a hero? I'll vote for someone else!","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,1,4,talk,Minako,,"The tension between Sakura and Takumi is becoming a distraction. While Takumi's aggression is misplaced, Sakura's deflection is also noteworthy. However, we must decide based on the most likely candidate for the werewolf. I will cast my vote.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Sakura"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,1,4,talk,Victoria,,"The conflict between Sakura and Takumi is unproductive. However, Sakura's attempt to frame calmness as suspicious is a weak deflection. Given the current dynamics, she is the most logically inconsistent. I will vote for Sakura.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Sakura"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,1,4,talk,Takumi,,"@Victoria, finally you're agreeing with me! @Sakura, your ""innocent"" act isn't working. You're just trying to confuse us with your laughing and pointing fingers. I'm voting for Sakura! Let's get rid of the wolf now!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Victoria"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,1,4,talk,Misaki,,"@Sakura, your behavior is indeed a bit distracting, but @Takumi's aggression is equally problematic. However, following the logic of the majority and the observations made by Victoria, Sakura seems the most likely candidate for now. I will vote for Sakura.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Sakura"",""Takumi"",""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
